# Jira/Confluence Cloud - Local POC API Token (REST fallback only)
#
# Only needed if you exercise the REST API fallback path for
# jira-issues / confluence-pages (the primary path is the Atlassian Rovo
# MCP Server, which uses interactive OAuth and needs no token file).
#
# Copy to "jira-token.txt" (no .example suffix, gitignored, never
# committed). Create at https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens .
# Shared with Confluence Cloud REST calls against the same Atlassian site.
#
# Format: the raw API token value only.
REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ATLASSIAN_API_TOKEN
